  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Third-Party Monitoring, Evaluation and Learning Contract</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a contract with a third-party provider over the second and third years of the programme, to verify our implementers&apos; activities and ensure that all the equipment delivered is in the right place and operating correctly. This will monitor generators (initial fossil fuel generators provided via BEIS and the later solar generators) as well as the Energy Community contribution. This is RDEL.</narrative>
  </description>
